  "motivation": "This change introduces a new S3-based chat memory repository for Spring AI. It allows users to store and retrieve conversation history in an AWS S3 bucket, offering a scalable and durable solution for chat memory persistence. The change includes the core repository implementation, auto-configuration, necessary Maven POM files, and integration tests.",
